── SYNTAX ERROR ──────────────────────────────────── E0100_guard.lt:2:9  [E0100]

Stilt has no `guard`: write `if !(…) { … }`, or `let x = o else …`:

  2 │   guard n % 2 == 0 else { raise "odd" }
    │         ^

`else` after a pattern of `let` runs when the pattern doesn't match, and must
leave the block.
